# HY320 (MagCubic, 2024): one unit, its owner's, dumped in full over ADB on 31.10.2026 (README.md). The HY350's
# DRAM words and display firmware, a 1080p dual-port panel at project 0x30 with this board's own raster, the
# HY300 Pro's lamp (display-firmware PWM5) and fan tacho (PH17). Below "verified": TEST images for its owner
# only, never a release image (boards/README.md).
BOARD_ID=hy320
STATUS=partial
VERIFIED_BY=
PROFILE=hy320
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy320
# kernel patch: sun50i-h713-hy320.dts, the board's stock device tree held against the HY300 Pro / HY310 trees
KERNEL_DTB=sun50i-h713-hy320
# hy320_defconfig in the U-Boot fork: this board's DRAM block (792 MHz) and its own panel row for project 0x30
UBOOT_BOARD=hy320
# FEATURES (boards/README.md) deliberately unset: nothing has run under our firmware yet. camera: none (no V4L2
# device and no camera under stock, 30.10.2026); accelerometer: an STK8BA58 (stk,stk83xx) at 0x18 on twi1 in the
# stock tree, not driven by ours; focus-motor: motor_ctr is disabled in the stock tree.
